{"id":"f403c224ddb070f8","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-modal-associated-system.md","title":"Abstract Systems Associated with Modal Calculi","display":"df-modal-associated-system — Abstract Systems Associated with Modal Calculi","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-modal-associated-system","aliases":["92-df-modal-associated-system"],"display":"df-modal-associated-system — Abstract Systems Associated with Modal Calculi","source":"第 XI 章 p. 133（PDF 150）","source_status":"原书内容的显式重构","depends_on":["[[92-df-modal-k-k4-g]]","[[92-df-provable]]","[[92-df-abstract-provability-system]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-modal-associated-system"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-modal-associated-system</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-modal-associated-system — Abstract Systems Associated with Modal Calculi"},{"key":"source","html":"第 XI 章 p. 133（PDF 150）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的显式重构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e69e849d9714457a\" href=\"?note=e69e849d9714457a\" title=\"92-df-modal-k-k4-g\">92-df-modal-k-k4-g</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"51c43e0240787ebb\" href=\"?note=51c43e0240787ebb\" title=\"92-df-provable\">92-df-provable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7c85c79ae7f29681\" href=\"?note=7c85c79ae7f29681\" title=\"92-df-abstract-provability-system\">92-df-abstract-provability-system</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\in\\{\\mathsf K_{\\Box},\\mathsf{K4}_{\\Box},\\mathsf G_{\\Box}\\}\">\\(U\\in\\{\\mathsf K_{\\Box},\\mathsf{K4}_{\\Box},\\mathsf G_{\\Box}\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash\">\\(\\vdash\\)</span> 是无假设有限证明可证关系。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M_{\\Box}(U),\\mathcal M^0_{\\Box}(U),P_U\">\\(\\mathcal M_{\\Box}(U),\\mathcal M^0_{\\Box}(U),P_U\\)</span> 为以下五元组和元素集。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box},\\mathrm{LF}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box},\\mathrm{LF}_{\\Box}\\)</span> 分别为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4c908091e8e31a3b\" href=\"?note=4c908091e8e31a3b\" title=\"92-df-modal-language\">92-df-modal-language</a> 的公式域和 letterless 域。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}modal\\text{-}associated\\text{-}system}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\nP_U&amp;\\coloneqq\\{F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}:U\\vdash F\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal M_{\\Box}(U)&amp;\\coloneqq(\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box},\\bot,\\operatorname{imp}_{\\Box},P_U,\\operatorname{box}),\\\\\n\\mathcal M^0_{\\Box}(U)&amp;\\coloneqq(\\mathrm{LF}_{\\Box},\\bot,\n\\operatorname{imp}_{\\Box}|_{\\mathrm{LF}_{\\Box}^2},P_U\\cap\\mathrm{LF}_{\\Box},\n\\operatorname{box}|_{\\mathrm{LF}_{\\Box}}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}modal\\text{-}associated\\text{-}system}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\nP_U&amp;\\coloneqq\\{F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}:U\\vdash F\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal M_{\\Box}(U)&amp;\\coloneqq(\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box},\\bot,\\operatorname{imp}_{\\Box},P_U,\\operatorname{box}),\\\\\n\\mathcal M^0_{\\Box}(U)&amp;\\coloneqq(\\mathrm{LF}_{\\Box},\\bot,\n\\operatorname{imp}_{\\Box}|_{\\mathrm{LF}_{\\Box}^2},P_U\\cap\\mathrm{LF}_{\\Box},\n\\operatorname{box}|_{\\mathrm{LF}_{\\Box}}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书关联结构以所有 modal formulas 作抽象系统的“sentences”；M^0 是 letterless 子系统。两者符合 ProvSys 签名。</p>\n<p>P_U 的限制按全演算的可证结论取交集，不要求原证明每行都 letterless；需要时可把命题变量统一代成底，保持其 letterless 结论。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-modal-k-k4-g","status":"resolved","id":"e69e849d9714457a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-modal-k-k4-g]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-provable","status":"resolved","id":"51c43e0240787ebb","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-provable]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-abstract-provability-system","status":"resolved","id":"7c85c79ae7f29681","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-abstract-provability-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-modal-language","status":"resolved","id":"4c908091e8e31a3b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box},\\mathrm{LF}_{\\Box}$ 分别为 [[92-df-modal-language]] 的公式域和 letterless 域。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"U\\in\\{\\mathsf K_{\\Box},\\mathsf{K4}_{\\Box},\\mathsf G_{\\Box}\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\vdash","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal M_{\\Box}(U),\\mathcal M^0_{\\Box}(U),P_U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box},\\mathrm{LF}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}modal\\text{-}associated\\text{-}system}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\nP_U&\\coloneqq\\{F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}:U\\vdash F\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal M_{\\Box}(U)&\\coloneqq(\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box},\\bot,\\operatorname{imp}_{\\Box},P_U,\\operatorname{box}),\\\\\n\\mathcal M^0_{\\Box}(U)&\\coloneqq(\\mathrm{LF}_{\\Box},\\bot,\n\\operatorname{imp}_{\\Box}|_{\\mathrm{LF}_{\\Box}^2},P_U\\cap\\mathrm{LF}_{\\Box},\n\\operatorname{box}|_{\\mathrm{LF}_{\\Box}}).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1633,"backlinks":[{"id":"62ba454c37d12a16","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-120","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-modal-language]] → [[92-df-modal-k-k4-g]] → [[92-df-modal-associated-system]] → [[92-prop-modal-system-types]]。"},{"id":"8efcec738ec44109","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"911d25a82b6a7593","anchor":"ref-151","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-modal-associated-system]]"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-103","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-modal-associated-system]]"}],"outgoing":["e69e849d9714457a","51c43e0240787ebb","7c85c79ae7f29681","4c908091e8e31a3b"]}